    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822980/extras/f1acefb6813684a6382d815fa04714ad.avif?t=1753320416\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LOCKED IN A FIRE TOWER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A [HOST] challenges you to a deadly game of chance where a <strong><i>forest fire</i></strong> spreads with each flip of a card.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose where the fire spreads, but only on <i><strong>your</strong></i> side of the field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The more turns you take, the closer the fire gets.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822980/extras/02483677d08890e694a482ad4cb6a5da.poster.avif?t=1753320416\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822980/extras/02483677d08890e694a482ad4cb6a5da.webm?t=1753320416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822980/extras/02483677d08890e694a482ad4cb6a5da.mp4?t=1753320416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A GAME OF CHANCE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some cards have a chance to deliver a <i><strong>random utility</strong></i>, or force you to <i><strong>take another turn</strong></i>. Choose wisely. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822980/extras/8e4cc2919d7f107a2faccfe7ef6c50d0.poster.avif?t=1753320416\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822980/extras/8e4cc2919d7f107a2faccfe7ef6c50d0.webm?t=1753320416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822980/extras/8e4cc2919d7f107a2faccfe7ef6c50d0.mp4?t=1753320416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >USE UTILITIES TO OUTWIT THE [HOST]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Utility has unique way of <strong><i>skewing the odds of the game.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use their various effects to your advantage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822980/extras/278aaefb508ffc623717f6fddef6170c.poster.avif?t=1753320416\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822980/extras/278aaefb508ffc623717f6fddef6170c.webm?t=1753320416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822980/extras/278aaefb508ffc623717f6fddef6170c.mp4?t=1753320416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\t</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A ZERO-SUM GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every card type has a <strong><i>fixed amount</i></strong>. Count them to make the best decision possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But count carefully, <strong><i>the [HOST] is keeping track as well</i></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How well does your memory stack up?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822980/extras/095aac5187357990578522745e3b1654.poster.avif?t=1753320416\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822980/extras/095aac5187357990578522745e3b1654.webm?t=1753320416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822980/extras/095aac5187357990578522745e3b1654.mp4?t=1753320416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >3 POSSIBLE ENDINGS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each ending has a <strong><i>unique title screen</i></strong>, revealing a deeper story to the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822980/extras/15dc423b0e75adb2c665e4b3cf0dda26.poster.avif?t=1753320416\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822980/extras/15dc423b0e75adb2c665e4b3cf0dda26.webm?t=1753320416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822980/extras/15dc423b0e75adb2c665e4b3cf0dda26.mp4?t=1753320416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822980/extras/f1acefb6813684a6382d815fa04714ad.avif?t=1753320416\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LOCKED IN A FIRE TOWER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A [HOST] challenges you to a deadly game of chance where a <strong><i>forest fire</i></strong> spreads with each flip of a card.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose where the fire spreads, but only on <i><strong>your</strong></i> side of the field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The more turns you take, the closer the fire gets.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822980/extras/02483677d08890e694a482ad4cb6a5da.poster.avif?t=1753320416\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822980/extras/02483677d08890e694a482ad4cb6a5da.webm?t=1753320416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822980/extras/02483677d08890e694a482ad4cb6a5da.mp4?t=1753320416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A GAME OF CHANCE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some cards have a chance to deliver a <i><strong>random utility</strong></i>, or force you to <i><strong>take another turn</strong></i>. Choose wisely. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822980/extras/8e4cc2919d7f107a2faccfe7ef6c50d0.poster.avif?t=1753320416\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822980/extras/8e4cc2919d7f107a2faccfe7ef6c50d0.webm