    "reviews": "\u201cThe theming is delightful here and sets it apart from being a simple card-based strategy game.\u201d<br>Demo Disk Review<br><br>\u201cIf you're a fan of Buckshot Roulette and just love its adrenaline-fueled, unpredictable gameplay that blends chance and strategy, you're sure to enjoy the strategic battle in ARSONATE, a unique first-person card-based strategy game that draws inspiration from Buckshot Roulette.\u201d<br>80 Level<br><br>\u201cUtilities are executed with pleasing literalness: I have yet to win any real-life cardgames by embedding a fireaxe in the table, but I'm keen to try it during my next round of Cosmic Encounters.\u201d<br>Rock Paper Shotgun<br>",
